---
const layers = [
  'sample.png',
  '├── PNG Header',
  '├── C2PA Manifest',
  '├── XMP CreatorTool',
  '├── digitalSourceType',
  '├── claim_generator',
  '└── Embedded Parameters',
];
---
<figure class="file-anatomy" aria-label="文件结构解剖示例">
  <pre class="mono anatomy-tree">{layers.map((l, i) => <span class="anatomy-line" style={`--i:${i}`}>{l}</span>)}</pre>
  <figcaption class="muted" data-i18n="anatomy.caption">AICheck365 查看文件内部，而不是凭画面猜测。</figcaption>
</figure>
